  "title": "Pumpkin Spice Cake with Cinnamon Cream Cheese Frosting",
  "description": "This pumpkin spice cake with cinnamon cream cheese frosting recipe features a cake made with pumpkin and spices, and a cinnamon cream cheese frosting.",
